### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# Personal IDE state (workspace layout, breakpoints, local run history, theme choice) has no
# business being shared across a team — only the specific files below are worth committing,
# and only if this project deliberately wants to share run configs/code style/inspections.
.idea/*
!.idea/runConfigurations
!.idea/codeStyles
!.idea/inspectionProfiles
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

